window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-033-50002a397393ddb3.json"]={sha256:"50002a397393ddb3b0df067c21bea62b32fddcf6d31ffff307ed533c9010b413",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-4db98038249d8c33","url":"https://www.nist.gov/programs-projects/ion-traps","title":"Ion Traps","titleEn":"Ion Traps","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-033","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-033","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-034","referenceUrls":["https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware"],"title":"IonQ 糾纏門：運動相空間閉合時間","titleEn":"IonQ entangling gates: motional phase-space closure time","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付等待—聲子圖、斜率驗證及冷卻插入位置。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver wait/phonon plots, slope verification and recooling insertion points. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IonQ 糾纏門：運動相空間閉合時間』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付相空間迴圈、閉合殘差與幾何相位待驗清單。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IonQ entangling gates: motional phase-space closure time', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver phase-space loops, closure residuals and unverified geometric-phase requirements.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：短時間常數加熱代理n̄(t)=n̄0+ṉt；不包括重新冷卻、模式耦合或非線性飽和。 使用教學n̄0=0.05、ṉ=10聲子/s、等待20 ms。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.05+10*0.020，另開一欄執行獨立核對：從5與20 ms兩點斜率反算10聲子/s；時間必須先換成秒。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：單模式驅動的相空間迴圈在δt=2π時閉合；δ為rad/s。閉合本身不保證正確糾纏相位。 使用教學失諧δ/(2π)=20 kHz；以μs求一圈時間，排除其他模式。 以手算或試算表計算名義式1/20e3*1e6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：用exp(iδt)的cos與sin分量驗證終點(1,0)；另列需調整的力幅度以維持幾何相位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Short-time constant-heating proxy n̄(t)=n̄0+ṉt excludes recooling, mode coupling and nonlinear saturation. Use Teaching n̄0=0.05, heating rate10 phonons/s and wait20 ms. Evaluate nominal expression 0.05+10*0.020 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Recover10 phonons/s from the5 and20 ms slope; convert time to seconds first.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: A single-mode driven phase-space loop closes when δt=2π, with δ in rad/s; closure alone does not guarantee the desired entangling phase. Use Teaching detuning δ/(2π)=20 kHz; solve one-loop time in μs with other modes excluded. Evaluate nominal expression 1/20e3*1e6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check endpoint(1,0) using cos and sin of δt; separately list force-amplitude adjustment needed to preserve geometric phase.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-043","referenceUrls":["https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform"],"title":"QuEra 原子重排：每次搬移損失的累積","titleEn":"QuEra atom rearrangement: accumulated transport loss","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付等待—聲子圖、斜率驗證及冷卻插入位置。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver wait/phonon plots, slope verification and recooling insertion points. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『QuEra 原子重排：每次搬移損失的累積』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付逐原子搬移圖、分段損失與目標佔據驗收。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'QuEra atom rearrangement: accumulated transport loss', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver atom-by-atom move maps, segment losses and target-occupancy acceptance.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：短時間常數加熱代理n̄(t)=n̄0+ṉt；不包括重新冷卻、模式耦合或非線性飽和。 使用教學n̄0=0.05、ṉ=10聲子/s、等待20 ms。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.05+10*0.020，另開一欄執行獨立核對：從5與20 ms兩點斜率反算10聲子/s；時間必須先換成秒。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立搬移的生存代理P=s^m，s為單次存活、m為搬移次數；不假設移動越短就必然無損。 使用教學s=0.995、關鍵原子需m=10次搬移。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.995**10，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以−lnP=m(−lns)驗證累積；逐原子列表，不能把不同原子的搬移次數混為同一路徑。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Short-time constant-heating proxy n̄(t)=n̄0+ṉt excludes recooling, mode coupling and nonlinear saturation. Use Teaching n̄0=0.05, heating rate10 phonons/s and wait20 ms. Evaluate nominal expression 0.05+10*0.020 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Recover10 phonons/s from the5 and20 ms slope; convert time to seconds first.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Independent-transport survival proxy P=s^m uses per-move survival s and move count m; shorter motion is not assumed lossless. Use Teaching s=0.995 and m=10 moves for a critical atom. Evaluate nominal expression 0.995**10 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Verify−lnP=m(−lns); list each atom separately rather than combining different paths.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-be4f718fe09216f8","url":"https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware","title":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","titleEn":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","publisher":"IonQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-03197d83dc430913","url":"https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform","title":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","titleEn":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","publisher":"QuEra","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
